WEBVTT

32:01.209 --> 32:03.459
Imagine how I must be feeling.
I'd be fuming with rage.

32:04.792 --> 32:08.167
That is why I went out of my way
and decided something.

32:08.625 --> 32:10.334
Every Saturday,

32:10.709 --> 32:16.417
I made it my duty to find his targets
at any cost and save them.
